OL,3,AHeating oil customers face tough winter
OL,4,Adespite shake-up promise
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeating oil customers facing soaring
OL,7,Fbills have been promised better
OL,8,Fregulation of the sector by the
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FMinisters say they will tighten up
OL,12,Frules, promote competition and give
OL,13,Fcustomers clearer compensation routes
OL,14,Fif things go wrong. Minimum order
OL,15,Flevels, set for some customers, will be
OL,16,Freviewed.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
